<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79539" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρηγορ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>exhortation, persuasion</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.1281
			</span></i> (pl.) : metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρίματος . . ἀδόλοισι παρηγορίαις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					95
				</span></i>
			 (anap.) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴση παρηγορία,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰσηγορία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1.17b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>surname</i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				4.8.3
			</span></i> (sed leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσηγ-</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>consolation</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ πένθους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Cim.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Per.</u>
				34
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υἱοῖο</span> for his loss, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				7.2544
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Thebes</span>) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁδευόντων π.</span>, of the moon, <i><span class="en">
				Secund.
				<u>Sent.</u>
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>assuagement</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diocl.Fr.
				142
			</span></i>, etc. ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ παροξυσμοῦ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CD</u>
					1.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
